  "goodToKnow": "Der Befehlshaber is a commander: der Befehlshaber der Streitkräfte. Under the Grundgesetz, the Federal Minister of Defence holds command over the Bundeswehr in peacetime (Article 65a), and it passes to the Chancellor in a state of defence (Article 115b); the President has no command role. Der Befehl is an order, and befehlen (befahl, befohlen) to command. The plural is the same: die Befehlshaber."
